      "writtenOn": "2020-12-18T01:56:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC, TCPMv1 registers the max voltage and current from the source caps and again from the PDO it already requested. TCPMv2 calls pd_set_input_current_limit only after PE_SNK_TRANSITION_SINK (for what\u0027s already negotiated). So, I\u0027m wondering in TCPMv2, the charge manager doesn\u0027t need to call pd_set_new_power_request at all (because basically the added conditions are always true).\n\nThoughts?",
      "parentUuid": "a73cb19b_06fcf29e",
      "revId": "9429ac939bbd47059e39ece0391df26cba141d87",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
